      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LAKEVIEW LYNETTE (4) had a tricky draw and ran well to finish second, beaten half a length, (29.97) at The Meadows. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Deserves serious consideration. KIA KEEPING (2) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 4.5 lengths at Mt Gambier in a handy 29.40 beating Swift Gift. Ran the fastest time on the program in her latest win. One of the leading chances again. MIKADO MANIA (1) stalked the lead from a low draw and fought on well to finish 2.25 lengths back in third (26.21) at Warragul in a Grade 5 over 460m. Overdue and is among the main hopes. MEPUNGA WILLOW (6) is a definite chance as a last start winner out of this box.",
